      "body": "Related to #2354.\n\n## Summary\nThe Qwen3.6 and Qwen3.8 READMEs did not document supported parallelisms, while other model READMEs (llama3, qwen3_5, flux, ...) do. Both models reuse the Qwen3.5 model implementation and parallelization, so this PR adds a `Supported Parallelisms` section to each README with the same table as Qwen3.5 (EP scoped to each model's MoE variant) and a link back to the Qwen3.5 docs.\n\nDocs-only change.",
